# Check every text file out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# Git for Windows enables autocrlf by default, which rewrites the working tree
# to CRLF on checkout. gofmt then reports every Go file as unformatted and
# golangci-lint fails before it has looked at any code, on a tree that differs
# from HEAD by nothing but line endings. Pinning the checkout here keeps a
# Windows contributor from having to discover that.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are compared byte for byte against golden output.
*.json -text
*.golden -text
